---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Schengen tourist visa · for Indian passport holders</p>
    <h1>Is your Schengen visa application ready?</h1>
    <p class="lead">Answer a few questions about your trip, passport and documents. Get a readiness score, the red flags to fix, your personal document checklist and the dates you must not miss.</p>
    <a class="btn big" href="/check">Check my application →</a>
    <p class="muted small">Free · about 3 minutes · no sign-up · nothing uploaded</p>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🛂</span>
      <h2>Red flags first</h2>
      <p class="muted">Passport expiring too soon, too few blank pages, applying too late, a trip over 90 days: the problems that get applications refused.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">📋</span>
      <h2>Your own checklist</h2>
      <p class="muted">Salaried, self-employed, student or retired: see exactly which documents you need, and tick them off as you go.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">📅</span>
      <h2>Your timeline</h2>
      <p class="muted">The earliest and latest days to apply, when to book your appointment and when to get fresh bank statements.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card facts">
    <h2>Schengen visa basics</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Apply <strong>at least 15 days</strong> and <strong>no earlier than 6 months</strong> before your trip.</li>
      <li>Stay up to <strong>90 days in any 180-day period</strong>.</li>
      <li>Apply to the country where you’ll <strong>spend the most nights</strong>; if equal, the country you enter first.</li>
      <li>Visa fee: <strong>€90</strong> for adults, <strong>€45</strong> for children aged 6–12, plus the visa centre’s service fee.</li>
      <li>Decision normally in <strong>15 days</strong>, up to 45 in some cases.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted small">Source: <a href="https://home-affairs.ec.europa.eu/policies/schengen-borders-and-visa/visa-policy/applying-schengen-visa_en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">European Commission – Applying for a Schengen visa</a>, checked 25 Nov 2026.</p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero { text-align: center; padding: 16px 0 32px; }
  .eyebrow { display: inline-block; background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 650; font-size: .85rem; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 99px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .lead { font-size: 1.12rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 22px; }
  .btn.big { padding: 15px 28px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .small { font-size: .88rem; margin: 12px 0 0; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .grid .icon { font-size: 1.7rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .grid h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .grid p { margin: 0; }
  .facts ul { margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 20px; }
  .facts li { margin: 5px 0; }
</style>
